
REQUESTS Simulation/SimulationComposition
REQUIRES physics/Eos/EosMain/Helmholtz/ExternalAbarZbar
REQUIRES physics/materialProperties/NSE

MASS_SCALAR ci
MASS_SCALAR nei

MASS_SCALAR phfa
MASS_SCALAR phaq
MASS_SCALAR phqn

MASS_SCALAR ye
MASS_SCALAR dyqn
MASS_SCALAR dqqn



PARAMETER bn_thermalReact           	BOOLEAN      true

D bn_autoDDT   Automatically detects when to transition from deflagration
D & to detonation based on conditions near the flame.  If bn_thermalReact
D & is false it will be set to true when simulation gets close to
D & detonation conditions.  Standard convention is to have bn_thermalReact
D & false until the approximately the detonation time to reduce the chances
D & of spurious detonations.
PARAMETER bn_autoDDT               BOOLEAN      false

PARAMETER bn_detIgnFile            BOOLEAN      false
PARAMETER bn_detIgnFileName        STRING       "detpoints.dat"

PARAMETER pbIgnRho                 REAL         1.0e7
PARAMETER pbIgnRhoCalib            REAL         0.0e0
PARAMETER pbIgnRhoFact             REAL         0.999
PARAMETER pbIgnPhfa                REAL         0.1
PARAMETER pbIgnDist                REAL         32.e5
PARAMETER pbIgnRad                 REAL         12.e5
PARAMETER pbIgnSep                 REAL         64.e5
PARAMETER pbIgnNumMax              INTEGER      100

PARAMETER bn_thermalReactInFlameThreshold  REAL  0.1
D bn_thermalReactInFlameThreshold  threshold for checking proximity of thermal
D &  burning to activate burning "inside" the flame front.   Thermal reactions
D &  within the flame front are only enabled if phi_fa - flam > this threshold
D &  somewhere within about one flame width of the cell
